00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:48.183
I think I'd have to either...

00:08:48.183 --> 00:08:49.290
I'm gonna try this, but if not

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.679
I'm gonna have to take five off.

00:08:51.679 --> 00:08:52.512
Okay.

00:08:52.512 --> 00:08:53.970
