00:08:55.139 --> 00:08:57.000
(heavy metal music)

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:57.833
- Go right here.

00:08:57.833 --> 00:08:59.403
Big breath, big breath.

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.113
- You got it, you got it, you got it.

00:09:03.274 --> 00:09:06.191
(excited cheering)

00:09:07.233 --> 00:09:08.667
(buzzer rings)

00:09:08.667 --> 00:09:09.500
- So close!

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:10.333
- I felt that! It's going, then it's not!

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:13.322
I'm gonna go a little lighter.

00:09:13.322 --> 00:09:14.460
- So close!

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:15.480
- All right.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.313
Lightweight.

00:09:16.313 --> 00:09:17.146
- I hope so.

00:09:17.146 --> 00:09:17.979
Just seeing those weights on,

00:09:17.979 --> 00:09:20.971
just seeing them racket and
just like, "Okay, here we go."

00:09:20.971 --> 00:09:21.804
(heavy metal music)

00:09:21.804 --> 00:09:24.621
(excited cheering)

00:09:24.621 --> 00:09:25.454
- Good job!

00:09:25.454 --> 00:09:27.921
(bell dings)

00:09:27.921 --> 00:09:28.754
- I didn't think I was
gonna do that today!

00:09:28.754 --> 00:09:30.194
- I'm liking this.

00:09:30.194 --> 00:09:31.194
We all hella strong.

00:09:32.037 --> 00:09:33.910
(upbeat music)

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.043
- Okay, let's do it!

00:09:35.887 --> 00:09:38.264
(upbeat music)

00:09:38.264 --> 00:09:41.181
(excited cheering)

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:44.532
(bell dings)

00:09:44.532 --> 00:09:45.365
- Beautiful.

00:09:45.365 --> 00:09:47.948
(upbeat music)

00:09:52.084 --> 00:09:53.918
(upbeat music)

00:09:53.918 --> 00:09:55.893
(encouraging cheers)

00:09:55.893 --> 00:09:58.325
(bell dings)

00:09:58.325 --> 00:10:00.840
- Girl, I feel like you
needed silence in that one.

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:03.030
- I think it's really cool
to see people who are smaller

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:04.500
than me lift a lot more than me.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.910
And I feel like that's a misconception

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.080
a lot of people might have.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.109
- It's time.

00:10:08.109 --> 00:10:09.786
(energetic music)

00:10:09.786 --> 00:10:11.130
(encouraging chatter)

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.860
- Lock in, stay tight.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:16.230
Would this be a PR for you or...?

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.063
- Yes.

00:10:17.063 --> 00:10:17.896
- Cool.

00:10:17.896 --> 00:10:18.729
- Oh, dang. Okay.

00:10:18.729 --> 00:10:19.994
Let's go. Let's go.

00:10:19.994 --> 00:10:21.358
(applause)

00:10:21.358 --> 00:10:22.191
- You got this.

00:10:22.191 --> 00:10:23.599
This is your turn, now.

00:10:23.599 --> 00:10:26.720
(encouraging cheers)

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.674
(buzzer rings)

00:10:28.674 --> 00:10:29.507
- I felt that.

00:10:29.507 --> 00:10:31.173
- Do you wanna try again, or...?

00:10:31.173 --> 00:10:32.059
- I think I'm good.

00:10:32.059 --> 00:10:33.304
- You got this!

00:10:33.304 --> 00:10:37.320
(encouraging chanting)

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.141
- I'm like internally screaming.

00:10:39.141 --> 00:10:41.850
(applause)

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.267
- I'll like look at
the plates and be like,

00:10:43.267 --> 00:10:45.690
"Oh gosh, that looks intimidating."

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:48.993
But, with everyone cheering,
it kind of drowns that out.

00:10:48.993 --> 00:10:52.076
(encouraging cheers)

00:10:53.246 --> 00:10:56.004
- Come on, plant those feet. You got this!

00:10:56.004 --> 00:10:58.921
(excited cheering)

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:02.857
(excited cheering)

00:11:05.608 --> 00:11:07.998
(bell dings)

00:11:07.998 --> 00:11:11.250
(excited chatter)

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:12.314
- I was like, "Oh my Lord!"

00:11:12.314 --> 00:11:14.220
- You did it! You did it.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:15.480
- Being able to see how,

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:18.030
when a community comes together
to encourage one another,

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.490
it does produce really good results.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.900
- That's 315 right there.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:22.933
- That's crazy.

00:11:22.933 --> 00:11:23.766
- That was crazy.

00:11:23.766 --> 00:11:25.777
- It was a slow and graceful fall.

00:11:25.777 --> 00:11:26.610
- Yeah.

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:27.600
- It was like...

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:28.440
- That looked good, though

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:29.370
- That looked amazing.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:30.203
- Thank you.

00:11:30.203 --> 00:11:31.036
Thank you.

00:11:31.036 --> 00:11:32.880
Now, I'll get it next time,
and I'll get it cleaner.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.590
- What was your personal record?

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:36.543
- Oh, it was 295.

00:11:37.427 --> 00:11:39.227
It was 295, before.

00:11:39.227 --> 00:11:42.450
- It was a struggle of a 295.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:46.590
So, I was very surprised to
see, when I did 295 today.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.630
It just ripped-off before.

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:49.950
I feel like everyone should lift.

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.840
It's such a great foundation.

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:53.730
You're gonna feel good about yourself.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.230
You're gonna meet great people at the gym.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.580
And, also it's nice to see

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:58.440
what your body's capable of doing.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.870
- Yeah. Weightlifting rocks. (chuckles)

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.490
- [Host] Do you have any final thoughts?

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.950
- I'm really excited to take a shower.

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.390
- Overall, it was a great group

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:08.520
of women and a great experience.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:10.800
- People underestimate
women, probably a lot more

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:13.140
than they should and women are stronger

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:15.423
and more capable than
a lot of people think.

